"", "content": "It does not decay. Rain and snow don't affect it. It's often used as a writing surface, for making lists, sending messages, or cursing people.\r\n\r\nIt varies in style over time. Therefore, if you have a broken piece of pottery with a given style, you can tell how old the building was where it was found.\r\n\r\nIt was traded. You can learn something about a place by the amount of foreign pottery that is present there. A wealthy community will have a lot of foreign pottery, while a poor one will have none.", "created": "2024-11-27T19:11:16.524Z"}}, {"model": "blog.blog", "pk": 6, "fields": {"title": "Thicker palm", "image": "display_image/45186561_958354954335242_9146592336728293376_n-01_8r6RifL.jpeg", "image_description": "thicker palm", "slug": "", "content": "The Arecaceae is a family of perennial, flowering plants in the monocot order Arecales. Their growth form can be climbers, shrubs, tree-like and stemless plants, all commonly known as palms. Those having a tree-like form are colloquially called palm trees. Currently, 181 genera with around 2,600 species are known, ...", "created": "2024-11-27T19:12:04.865Z"}}, {"model": "users.customuser", "pk": 4, "fields": {"password": "pbkdf2_sha256$600000$Mvv1y4zbxUGUUKS1XPLjzR$1h0F0BuxhBrdML8fAlo8xtmOk3MzFsj/lilm07uABT0=", "last_login": "2025-01-25T22:00:51.619Z", "is_superuser": true, "first_name": "", "last_name": "", "is_staff": true, "is_active": true, "date_joined": "2024-11-25T21:24:45.391Z", "email": "erick_gitonga@ieee.org", "groups": [4], "user_permissions": []}}, {"model": "users.customuser", "pk": 5, "fields": {"password": "pbkdf2_sha256$600000$NPxvpVJTD7C84Ssc6hdtQz$N/pGIrSg3Jzk6oXbTKeKRCZljqOg3DvyPY5hM9z7tuU=", "last_login": "2024-11-26T12:08:07.719Z", "is_superuser": false, "first_name": "egitonga395@gmail.com", "last_name": "", "is_staff": false, "is_active": true, "date_joined": "2024-11-25T21:28:59.688Z", "email": "erickgitonga159@gmail.com", "groups": [3], "user_permissions": []}}, {"mo